ki, otlar botib qolardi.","wordRange":[29,39]},{"id":"s7","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":20.38,"end":24.18,"text":"Tik qoyadan Temurni yog'och kajavada arqonlarda pastga tushirishadi.","wordRange":[40,47]},{"id":"s8","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":24.78,"end":25.48,"text":"Besh marta.","wordRange":[48,49]},{"id":"s9","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":26.46,"end":26.98,"text":"Dekabr.","wordRange":[50,50]},{"id":"s10","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":27.52,"end":27.96,"text":"Dehli.","wordRange":[51,51]},{"id":"s11","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":28.4,"end":34.1,"text":"Sulton Mahmud va Malluxon o'n ming otliq, qirq ming piyoda va yuz yigirma fil bilan chiqadi.","wordRange":[52,67]},{"id":"s12","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":34.58,"end":35.94,"text":"Fillarga sovut kiydirilgan.","wordRange":[68,70]},{"id":"s13","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":36.26,"end":39.36,"text":"Ustida yog'och supa, supada besh-olti kamonchi.","wordRange":[71,76]},{"id":"s14","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":39.86,"end":42.8,"text":"Temur olimlaridan so'raydi:\"Jangda qayerda turasizlar?\"","wordRange":[77,81]},{"id":"s15","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":43.28,"end":46.5,"text":"Ular titrab aytadi:\"Bizning joyimiz ayollar yonida.\"","wordRange":[82,87]},{"id":"s16","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":46.94,"end":48.12,"text":"Temur kulib yuboradi.","wordRange":[88,90]},{"id":"s17","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":48.54,"end":50.82,"text":"Temur qarorgoh atrofiga handaq qazdiradi.","wordRange":[91,95]},{"id":"s18","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":51.1,"end":53.16,"text":"To'siq oldiga buyvollarni bog'latadi.","wordRange":[96,99]},{"id":"s19","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":53.6,"end":54.8,"text":"O'n yettinchi dekabr.","wordRange":[100,102]},{"id":"s20","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":55.2,"end":55.5,"text":"Tong.","wordRange":[103,103]},{"id":"s21","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":56,"end":57.64,"text":"Fillar oldinga yura boshlaydi.","wordRange":[104,107]},{"id":"s22","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":58.16,"end":60.14,"text":"Temur fillarga qarshi nima qildi?","wordRange":[108,112]},{"id":"s23","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":60.62,"end":63.48,"text":"Bitta shahzoda filning ro'parasiga qilich bilan chiqdi.","wordRange":[113,119]},{"id":"s24","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":63.98,"end":65.5,"text":"Ertaga yettinchi qismda.","wordRange":[120,122]},{"id":"s25","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":65.92,"end":68.54,"text":"Siz-chi fillarga qarshi oldinga chiqarmidingiz?","wordRange":[123,127]},{"id":"s26","speaker":"Speaker 0","start":68.92,"end":70.66,"text":"Ha yoki yo'q izohda yozing.","wordRange":[128,132]}],"model":"elevenlabs-scribe"}